# Semiconductor Manufacturing Process – Yield Prediction

## 📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on predicting semiconductor manufacturing process
outcomes using machine learning.

The project uses sensor/process measurements to classify manufacturing
samples into Pass or Fail categories.

## 🎯 Objectives

- Analyze semiconductor manufacturing sensor data.
- Clean and preprocess the dataset.
- Handle missing values.
- Analyze the Pass/Fail target distribution.
- Address class imbalance using SMOTE.
- Train multiple machine learning classification models.
- Compare model performance.
- Perform hyperparameter tuning using GridSearchCV.
- Identify important sensor features.
- Investigate whether feature reduction can maintain model performance.
- Save the final trained model.

## 📊 Dataset

Dataset: SECOM Semiconductor Manufacturing Dataset

- Samples: 1567
- Sensor measurements: 590
- Target:
  - -1 → Pass
  - 1 → Fail
- Timestamp information is available for the samples.

